%description:
Test that the result file reader removes the unit from count and totalCount
scalars in result files written by earlier OMNeT++ versions (which recorded the
unit of the statistic for these recording modes), and that fields of statistics
exported as scalars get the unit appropriate for the field.

%file: test.ned

network Test
{
}

%file: legacy.sca
version 3
run General-0-20260101-00:00:00-1
attr configname General
attr network Test
attr runnumber 0

scalar Test.node pkBytes:count 3
attr recordingmode count
attr unit B
scalar Test.node pkBytes:totalCount 3
attr recordingmode totalCount
attr unit B
scalar Test.node pkBytes:count+10 13
attr recordingmode count+10
attr unit B
scalar Test.node pkBytes:sum 60
attr recordingmode sum
attr unit B
statistic Test.node pkBytes:stats
field count 3
field mean 20
field stddev 10
field min 10
field max 30
field sum 60
field sqrsum 1400
attr recordingmode stats
attr unit B

%postrun-command: opp_scavetool export -T s -w -F OmnetppScalarFile -o exported.sca legacy.sca

%contains: exported.sca
scalar Test.node pkBytes:count 3
attr recordingmode count
scalar Test.node pkBytes:totalCount 3
attr recordingmode totalCount
scalar Test.node pkBytes:count+10 13
attr recordingmode count+10
attr unit B
scalar Test.node pkBytes:sum 60
attr recordingmode sum
attr unit B
scalar Test.node pkBytes:stats:count 3
attr recordingmode stats
scalar Test.node pkBytes:stats:sumweights 3
attr recordingmode stats
scalar Test.node pkBytes:stats:mean 20
attr recordingmode stats
attr unit B
scalar Test.node pkBytes:stats:stddev 10
attr recordingmode stats
attr unit B
scalar Test.node pkBytes:stats:min 10
attr recordingmode stats
attr unit B
scalar Test.node pkBytes:stats:max 30
attr recordingmode stats
attr unit B
scalar Test.node pkBytes:stats:numbins 0
attr recordingmode stats

